\packageTitle{qrinf}
}
\description{
\packageDescription{qrinf}
}
\details{
This package contains two convenience functions for inference regarding quantile regression models, adding
to the existing options of the quantreg package. Specifically, general linear hypothesis tests on the coefficient
vector of a multiple quantile regression model and on the quantile regression process are facilitated.
}
\author{
\packageAuthor{qrinf}
}
\references{
Koenker, R. (2005). Quantile regression. Cambridge University Press.\n
Laroy, N., & De Neve, J. (2026). Quantile regression: a tutorial for psychologists. Unpublished.
}
\keyword{package}

